## Utility scripts

### free_libvirt_resources.py

Inspects and frees Coriolis libvirt raw disk and PCI controller allocations
that are stuck in `attached` or `claimed` state. After a VM is deleted those
resources remain reserved in the SQLite DB, preventing new transfers from
picking them up.

    # List all resources and their current status
    python3 /root/free_libvirt_resources.py list

    # List only disks, or only controllers
    python3 /root/free_libvirt_resources.py list --resource disks
    python3 /root/free_libvirt_resources.py list --resource controllers

    # Filter by status
    python3 /root/free_libvirt_resources.py list --status attached
    python3 /root/free_libvirt_resources.py list --status claimed

    # Free a specific disk by WWN
    python3 /root/free_libvirt_resources.py free --wwn <wwn>

    # Free a specific PCI controller by address
    python3 /root/free_libvirt_resources.py free --pci-address 0000:03:00.0

    # Free all stuck disks and controllers (shows a confirmation prompt)
    python3 /root/free_libvirt_resources.py free --all
